@startuml
!theme vibrant
title Thread & Handler Interaction

actor User
participant MainActivity
participant "UI Thread" as UIThread
participant "Worker Thread" as WorkerThread
participant Handler

User -> MainActivity: Clicks "Use Handler" button
activate MainActivity

MainActivity -> WorkerThread: new Thread(...).start()
activate WorkerThread
MainActivity -> UIThread: log("Starting new Thread...")
deactivate MainActivity

note over WorkerThread: Heavy work (e.g., SystemClock.sleep())
... 5 seconds later ...

WorkerThread -> Handler: post(Runnable)
activate Handler
note right: Task finished. Posting UI update\nvia Handler associated with UI Thread's Looper.

Handler -> UIThread: Executes Runnable
activate UIThread
deactivate Handler

UIThread -> UIThread: log("Handler running... Success!")
note right: UI is safely updated.
deactivate UIThread

@enduml
